    excerpt: "A practical guide to generating painting leads for interior, exterior, and specialty painting work, from organic marketing to buying leads directly.",
    metaDescription: "How painting contractors get more leads in 2026 — organic marketing tactics, paid channels, and how buying painting leads fills gaps between jobs.",
